# Allowlist: ignore everything, then allow only what the image needs.
# New files and folders (data, secrets, venv ...) can never end up in the build by accident.
*

# Dependencies: the image builds its environment from the lock file
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version

# Code
!src/

# ... but no Python caches from src/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
